WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.970
Greater Manchester's economy was
worth 114.5 billion pounds in 2024.

2
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.150
That was the largest economy of
any combined authority in England.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.030
In real terms, it grew 59 per
cent between 2001 and 2024.

4
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.290
The UK grew 40.

5
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.790
So what changed in this northern
hub to make it grow so fast?

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.890
In this mission, you'll
map the UK's economic hubs,

7
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.950
and see how far London dominates.

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.450
Then you'll take Greater
Manchester's economy apart,

9
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.950
and ask who really gains from its growth.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.050
Your mission: find out what changed
in Greater Manchester's economy.
